    "diagnosis": "Rosai&ndash;Dorfman disease involving lymph node",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Cervical lymph node of an African child shows marked expansion of the sinuses by large histiocytes with emperipolesis, which are clearly demarcated from intervening darkly stained lymphoid tissue with abundant lymphocytes and plasma cells.",
